Changes from SimpleDiscordCrypt (2026): rebranded UI and icons; rewritten
module discovery for current Discord builds; new send/upload/receive hooks;
host-agnostic core with userscript, Manifest V3 extension, Vencord and
BetterDiscord builds; consent before automatic key exchanges; bug fixes.
